"A shard whose slot count lies just under a power of two keeps the full "
"eight counters for each slot. Compute :math:`\\lambda` at the middle and "
"at the end of the first window, and the Poisson estimate that a key seen "
"once reaches an estimate of 5 at each point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:517
msgid ""
"Hint: Only the ratio :math:`N/m` matters. At :math:`\\lambda = 1`, "
":math:`e^{-1} \\approx 0.3679`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:521
msgid ""
"Explain why a torn, copied or foreign slot can cost a hint and never "
"choose a server that may not serve, why the path never names a half-made "
"file, and why the sketch may overestimate a frequency but never "
"underestimate it."
